### GET ingredients
GET http://localhost:3000/ingredients?pageSize=20&sortBy=name

### Create ingredient
POST http://localhost:3000/ingredients
Authorization: Bearer 
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "wódka czysta",
    "description": "lorem ipsum",
    "photoUrl": "ebeebe",
    "containsAlcohol": true
} 

### Update ingredient
Patch http://localhost:3000/ingredients/6
Authorization: Bearer 
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "wódka czysta",
    "description": "lorem ipsum12312312312",
    "photoUrl": "ebeebe345dfg",
    "containsAlcohol": true
}